  "_objectives": "SPEC.md §7, §13. Eight aircraft, each in its pen: the pen hex behind it is its one charge point. The fuel bowser stands on the south apron between the middle two Ju 52s; its charge point is the one hex beside it whose blast takes in those two and no others (for M30's rule that it sets them off). The signals tent is the airfield's telephone exchange: blown, or its line cut by a scout. None is primary: the win is any N aircraft (data/missions.json). `art` (optional, art only) picks which picture of its kind is drawn: the Stukas' or the Ju 52s'.",
